{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03134","headline":"送赵都护赴安西 · 张九龄","name":"送赵都护赴安西","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将相有更践，简心良独难。\n远图尝画地，超拜乃登坛。\n戎即崑山序，车同渤海单。\n义无中国费，情必远人安。\n他日文兼武，而今栗且宽。\n自然来月窟，何用刺楼兰。\n南至三冬晚，西驰万里寒。\n封侯自有处，征马去嘽嘽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}